msgctxt "quest/021/BanVan003_02166:TEXT_BANVAN003_02166_LINUVALI_000_029:1"
msgid "Rouse Linu's strength with your mighty <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>dance</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, and she will send the Vundu fleeing! Quickly!"
msgstr "Воодушеви Лину своим могучим <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>танцем</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, и она прогонит вунду! Скорее!"

#. ja: 貴方から勇気をもらえれば、私は踊れる……<br>そんなふうに思えるのです！<br>どうか、お願いします！
#. de: Tanz von Na-Vanu-eeh wird Mut in Herzen von Linu Vali-ooh entfachen wie Feuersbrunst! Schnell, wecke Tanzesmut!
#. fr: <split " " 1><string $gs1></split>, j'ai le sentiment que te voir <i>danser</i> me donnera du courage et que je pourrai exécuter la danse du soleil à nouveau<nbsp>!
#. speaker: LINUVALI
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
